Dialogue: 0.0:00:00.00.0:00:09.91.Default..0.0.0..{\fad(500.500)\fnBookman Old Style\b1\fs45\pos(644.390)}TOHO{\b0}
Dialogue: 0.0:00:00.00.0:00:09.91.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H07D9FF&\1a&H00&\fad(500.500)\fnBookman Old Style\fs45\pos(640.684)}Toho Company. Ltd
Dialogue: 0.0:00:11.14.0:00:15.85.Default..0.0.0..{\fad(1000.1000)\fnArial\b0\fs35\pos(660.378)}Produced by Pikachu Project 98
Dialogue: 0.0:00:26.44.0:00:28.30.Default..0.0.0..The endlessly expanding Universe...
Dialogue: 0.0:00:28.82.0:00:31.45.Default..0.0.0..In a corner of this Universe lies a single planet...
Dialogue: 0.0:00:31.45.0:00:34.76.Default..0.0.0..Some time ago. mysterious creatures were born on it.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:16.68.0:01:19.17.Default..0.0.0..Over one hundred species.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:19.17.0:01:21.25.Default..0.0.0..These creatures are wrapped in mystery.
Dialogue: 0.0:01:21.25.0:01:23.74.Default..0.0.0..People call them Pocket Monsters...
Dialogue: 0.0:01:23.74.0:01:24.69.Default..0.0.0.....or for short...
Dialogue: 0.0:01:24.69.0:01:26.10.Default..0.0.0..Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:30.20.0:01:31.86.Default..0.0.0..It's Gänger!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:31.86.0:01:33.73.Default..0.0.0.....and they will be against...
Dialogue: 0.0:01:33.73.0:01:36.50.Default..0.0.0..The Rock heavyweight. Iwake!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:43.37.0:01:44.25.Default..0.0.0..There it is!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:44.25.0:01:46.10.Default..0.0.0..Gänger's Destruction Beam!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:47.24.0:01:50.26.Default..0.0.0..They've withstood it well!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:57.32.0:01:59.31.Default..0.0.0..Iwake's Fissure is explosive!
Dialogue: 0.0:01:59.31.0:02:01.32.Default..0.0.0..Super-effective!
Dialogue: 0.0:02:08.46.0:02:12.18.Default..0.0.0..This young boy is Satoshi. He's 10 years old.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:12.18.0:02:14.41.Default..0.0.0..This young boy lives in Masara Town.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:14.41.0:02:17.40.Default..0.0.0..When you turn 10. you're entitled to receive a starter Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0.0:02:17.40.0:02:20.88.Default..0.0.0.....from the town's Pokémon researcher. Professor Ohkido.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:20.88.0:02:24.68.Default..0.0.0..You can then embark on a journey. \Naiming to be a Pokémon trainer.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:31.96.0:02:35.28.Default..0.0.0..The Pokémon that Satoshi received is...
Dialogue: 0.0:02:35.28.0:02:36.56.Default..0.0.0.....Pikachu.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:39.66.0:02:41.86.Default..0.0.0..The journey did not start without hardship.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:41.86.0:02:44.82.Default..0.0.0..A flock of Onisuzume swooped on them without warning.
Dialogue: 0.0:02:50.66.0:02:52.50.Default..0.0.0..Stop it. Onisuzume!
Dialogue: 0.0:02:55.72.0:02:56.72.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.0:03:39.26.0:03:41.45.Default..0.0.0..I'm Satoshi from Masara Town!
Dialogue: 0.0:03:41.45.0:03:44.48.Default..0.0.0..I'm going to be the world's greatest Pokémon Master!
Dialogue: 0.0:03:44.48.0:03:46.56.Default..0.0.0..I won't lose to the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0.0:03:46.56.0:03:48.58.Default..0.0.0..I'm going to get you all in one shot!
Dialogue: 0.0:03:48.58.0:03:50.50.Default..0.0.0..Now. come and get me. Onisuzume!
Dialogue: 0.0:04:42.40.0:04:44.16.Default..0.0.0..You did that for me?
Dialogue: 0.0:04:59.38.0:05:00.65.Default..0.0.0..What's that?
Dialogue: 0.0:05:00.65.0:05:02.11.Default..0.0.0..No data.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:02.11.0:05:05.94.Default..0.0.0..There are still Illusionary Pokémon that are unknown in this world.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:12.60.0:05:15.58.Default..0.0.0..That is how Satoshi's journey began.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:16.28.0:05:19.67.Default..0.0.0..People entrust their respective dreams to Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:19.67.0:05:22.98.Default..0.0.0..There are trainers like Satoshi who aim to be a Pokémon Master...
Dialogue: 0.0:05:23.74.0:05:28.40.Default..0.0.0.....and people who pursue Illusionary Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:37.84.0:05:41.35.Default..0.0.0..The Illusionary Pokémon. Mew?
Dialogue: 0.0:05:41.35.0:05:45.51.Default..0.0.0..They have mysterious powers and have been said to have caused a great flood...
Dialogue: 0.0:05:45.51.0:05:50.15.Default..0.0.0.....and helped a wasteland bear crops and distributed them to the people...
Dialogue: 0.0:05:50.15.0:05:52.88.Default..0.0.0..Various legends about this one have been passed down.
Dialogue: 0.0:05:52.88.0:05:54.75.Default..0.0.0..Are they an angel or a demon?
Dialogue: 0.0:05:54.75.0:05:56.64.Default..0.0.0..A fickle being?
Dialogue: 0.0:05:56.64.0:06:00.02.Default..0.0.0..It's said they have eternal life.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:00.02.0:06:02.05.Default..0.0.0..But. they're extinct. are they not?
Dialogue: 0.0:06:02.05.0:06:05.18.Default..0.0.0..Even so. there's been stories of Mew sightings.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:05.18.0:06:07.85.Default..0.0.0..They've been reported quite recently.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:07.85.0:06:09.62.Default..0.0.0..They're all unconfirmed.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:09.62.0:06:10.69.Default..0.0.0..True.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:10.69.0:06:13.45.Default..0.0.0..Not a single decent photograph has been taken.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:13.45.0:06:14.37.Default..0.0.0..Also true.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:35.06.0:06:36.04.Default..0.0.0..This is Mew.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:36.79.0:06:37.38.Default..0.0.0..Oh?
Dialogue: 0.0:06:46.24.0:06:50.28.Default..0.0.0.....and this is a fossil we've found recently.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:50.28.0:06:52.03.Default..0.0.0..A part of Mew's body?
Dialogue: 0.0:06:52.03.0:06:53.29.Default..0.0.0..That's what we suspect.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:53.29.0:06:55.70.Default..0.0.0..Let's bring it back to the laboratory at once.
Dialogue: 0.0:06:55.70.0:06:58.20.Default..0.0.0..If this truly is a Mew fossil...
Dialogue: 0.0:06:59.32.0:07:01.91.Default..0.0.0..We could create the ultimate Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:44.59.0:07:46.42.Default..0.0.0..What is this place?
Dialogue: 0.0:07:47.09.0:07:48.96.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:07:49.47.0:07:52.14.Default..0.0.0..Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0.0:07:52.14.0:07:54.76.Default..0.0.0..This one is no different from the other copies.
Dialogue: 0.0:07:54.76.0:07:56.81.Default..0.0.0..Why won't they awaken?
Dialogue: 0.0:07:56.81.0:08:00.42.Default..0.0.0..In theory. there should be nothing wrong...
Dialogue: 0.0:08:00.42.0:08:02.64.Default..0.0.0..Perhaps there's some trigger for their birth?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:01.69.0:08:04.77.Default..0.0.0..Someone is talking about me?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:03.46.0:08:04.20.Default..0.0.0..Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:04.77.0:08:07.23.Default..0.0.0..But what are they saying?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:07.23.0:08:10.40.Default..0.0.0..That's the human language.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:12.37.0:08:14.20.Default..0.0.0..Who are you?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:14.20.0:08:18.37.Default..0.0.0..A human. but my existence is just like yours.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:18.37.0:08:19.92.Default..0.0.0..Human?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:19.92.0:08:21.68.Default..0.0.0..Am I also a human?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:22.25.0:08:25.43.Default..0.0.0..You can talk. so you might be human!
Dialogue: 0.0:08:25.43.0:08:28.17.Default..0.0.0.....or maybe I'm a Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:08:28.76.0:08:31.72.Default..0.0.0..Human? Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:31.72.0:08:34.17.Default..0.0.0..What are they? Which am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:34.68.0:08:38.88.Default..0.0.0..Either one is fine. you and I are just the same.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:40.85.0:08:44.01.Default..0.0.0..Everyone in this place is just like us!
Dialogue: 0.0:08:50.86.0:08:51.82.Default..0.0.0..This means...
Dialogue: 0.0:08:51.82.0:08:54.43.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo and Itwo are communicating.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:54.43.0:08:57.08.Default..0.0.0..The other copies are responding too.
Dialogue: 0.0:08:57.08.0:08:58.53.Default..0.0.0..Telepathy?
Dialogue: 0.0:08:58.53.0:09:02.95.Default..0.0.0..I cannot confirm that. but I think that's a reasonable possibility.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:15.93.0:09:17.09.Default..0.0.0..I...
Dialogue: 0.0:09:22.77.0:09:25.35.Default..0.0.0..We are all copies.
Dialogue: 0.0:09:25.35.0:09:27.77.Default..0.0.0..That means we're not One. We're Two!
Dialogue: 0.0:09:27.77.0:09:29.53.Default..0.0.0..So that means I'm Two?
Dialogue: 0.0:09:29.53.0:09:33.98.Default..0.0.0..I'm Itwo. but I am the real I!
Dialogue: 0.0:09:46.29.0:09:49.79.Default..0.0.0..I. what could you be saying?
Dialogue: 0.0:09:50.46.0:09:53.71.Default..0.0.0..My precious daughter. I.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:00.35.0:10:01.38.Default..0.0.0..Dear...
Dialogue: 0.0:10:02.68.0:10:06.27.Default..0.0.0..What do you think of this holograph? Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0.0:10:06.27.0:10:09.92.Default..0.0.0..I have recreated the patterns of I's consciousness electronically!
Dialogue: 0.0:10:09.92.0:10:12.44.Default..0.0.0..What would you do that for?
Dialogue: 0.0:10:12.44.0:10:14.20.Default..0.0.0..I is not coming back.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:14.20.0:10:15.36.Default..0.0.0..You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:15.36.0:10:16.64.Default..0.0.0..Look!
Dialogue: 0.0:10:16.64.0:10:19.62.Default..0.0.0..I can clearly observe conscious activity.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:19.62.0:10:21.95.Default..0.0.0..I is in this light.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:24.46.0:10:25.95.Default..0.0.0..I...
Dialogue: 0.0:10:27.08.0:10:30.91.Default..0.0.0..I cannot live tied down by memories...
Dialogue: 0.0:10:32.09.0:10:33.46.Default..0.0.0..Farewell.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:44.14.0:10:47.47.Default..0.0.0..I shall name this holograph... Itwo.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:50.90.0:10:52.93.Default..0.0.0..A Mew fossil?
Dialogue: 0.0:10:52.93.0:10:55.48.Default..0.0.0..The Illusionary Pokémon Mew?
Dialogue: 0.0:10:56.07.0:10:59.35.Default..0.0.0..It's said they have an eternal life force.
Dialogue: 0.0:10:59.35.0:11:02.49.Default..0.0.0..We have obtained a fossil of their eyelash.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:03.24.0:11:08.69.Default..0.0.0..To create Pokémon copies... To create the ultimate Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0.0:11:08.69.0:11:13.21.Default..0.0.0..If I can procure the secret to their tenacious life force...
Dialogue: 0.0:11:13.21.0:11:18.00.Default..0.0.0..I might be able to grant Itwo true life.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:18.84.0:11:20.01.Default..0.0.0..I...
Dialogue: 0.0:11:20.01.0:11:22.51.Default..0.0.0..Come back to me. I...
Dialogue: 0.0:11:32.48.0:11:37.90.Default..0.0.0..This is the place I was born and raised inside I's memory.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:41.16.0:11:42.24.Default..0.0.0..What is that?
Dialogue: 0.0:11:42.24.0:11:44.37.Default..0.0.0..That's the Sun. of course.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:44.37.0:11:45.95.Default..0.0.0..The Sun?
Dialogue: 0.0:11:45.95.0:11:49.91.Default..0.0.0..It gives us light and warmth.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:49.91.0:11:50.72.Default..0.0.0..Wow...
Dialogue: 0.0:11:53.04.0:11:54.80.Default..0.0.0..This is the wind.
Dialogue: 0.0:11:54.80.0:11:56.21.Default..0.0.0..Wind?
Dialogue: 0.0:11:58.92.0:12:02.10.Default..0.0.0..Sometimes it's gentle and sometimes it's fierce...
Dialogue: 0.0:12:02.10.0:12:03.44.Default..0.0.0..But it still pushes us along.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:08.52.0:12:09.76.Default..0.0.0..This is the sunset sky.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:09.76.0:12:12.31.Default..0.0.0..It's saying let us meet again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:13.15.0:12:14.58.Default..0.0.0..What's that?
Dialogue: 0.0:12:14.58.0:12:17.49.Default..0.0.0..The Stars and the Moon.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:17.49.0:12:23.07.Default..0.0.0..They're here so the dark nights aren't lonely. they let us know we're not alone.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:29.58.0:12:31.75.Default..0.0.0..Hitokagetwo's life response is declining...
Dialogue: 0.0:12:31.75.0:12:33.49.Default..0.0.0..It has now been terminated.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:33.49.0:12:35.25.Default..0.0.0..It's happening again then?
Dialogue: 0.0:12:42.38.0:12:46.08.Default..0.0.0..Zenigametwo and Fushigidanetwo have also been terminated.
Dialogue: 0.0:12:46.08.0:12:48.47.Default..0.0.0..So this round was another failure after all?
Dialogue: 0.0:12:55.36.0:12:57.10.Default..0.0.0..Where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0.0:13:13.46.0:13:15.75.Default..0.0.0..Itwo's response signal is declining.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:15.75.0:13:17.66.Default..0.0.0..Terminated.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:19.34.0:13:20.62.Default..0.0.0..I...
Dialogue: 0.0:13:27.81.0:13:29.10.Default..0.0.0..What's the matter. I?
Dialogue: 0.0:13:29.10.0:13:30.18.Default..0.0.0..Is something happening?
Dialogue: 0.0:13:30.98.0:13:34.14.Default..0.0.0..It seems our time to part is near.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:35.04.0:13:35.82.Default..0.0.0..I...
Dialogue: 0.0:13:43.99.0:13:46.19.Default..0.0.0..Something is coming out of my eyes...
Dialogue: 0.0:13:48.70.0:13:49.86.Default..0.0.0..What is this?
Dialogue: 0.0:13:50.37.0:13:51.61.Default..0.0.0..Tears.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:51.61.0:13:52.66.Default..0.0.0..Tears?
Dialogue: 0.0:13:52.66.0:13:57.54.Default..0.0.0..They say living creatures do not cry tears unless their bodies are hurt.
Dialogue: 0.0:13:58.09.0:14:02.21.Default..0.0.0..Only humans cry tears out of sadness.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:07.24.0:14:08.28.Default..0.0.0..Thank you.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:08.28.0:14:08.68.Default..0.0.0..Huh?
Dialogue: 0.0:14:09.85.0:14:12.89.Default..0.0.0..Thank you for your tears.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:12.89.0:14:17.02.Default..0.0.0..But do not cry. you are still living.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:17.02.0:14:19.82.Default..0.0.0..Keep on living. okay?
Dialogue: 0.0:14:19.82.0:14:22.35.Default..0.0.0..I'm sure it must be a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0.0:14:32.20.0:14:35.41.Default..0.0.0..I. my tears won't stop...
Dialogue: 0.0:14:35.41.0:14:37.42.Default..0.0.0..What should I do?
Dialogue: 0.0:14:37.42.0:14:39.75.Default..0.0.0..Answer me. I!
Dialogue: 0.0:14:44.51.0:14:46.43.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo's brain waves are going berserk.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:46.43.0:14:48.36.Default..0.0.0..They appear to be oscillating considerably.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:48.36.0:14:50.68.Default..0.0.0..We cannot stimulate right now.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:50.68.0:14:53.53.Default..0.0.0..Insert the stabiliser and put them to sleep!
Dialogue: 0.0:14:53.53.0:14:55.26.Default..0.0.0..Stabiliser injected.
Dialogue: 0.0:14:56.98.0:14:57.80.Default..0.0.0..10...
Dialogue: 0.0:14:57.80.0:14:58.56.Default..0.0.0..20...
Dialogue: 0.0:14:58.56.0:14:59.28.Default..0.0.0..30...
Dialogue: 0.0:14:59.88.0:15:00.78.Default..0.0.0..40...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:00.78.0:15:01.85.Default..0.0.0..50...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:01.85.0:15:02.68.Default..0.0.0..60...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:02.68.0:15:03.74.Default..0.0.0..70...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:03.74.0:15:04.40.Default..0.0.0..80...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:04.74.0:15:05.65.Default..0.0.0..90...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:05.65.0:15:06.85.Default..0.0.0..100...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:04.40.0:15:06.73.Default..0.0.0..Their brainwaves are returning to normal.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:06.85.0:15:08.90.Default..0.0.0..Stabiliser injection complete.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:12.70.0:15:14.72.Default..0.0.0..Brainwaves are normal.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:14.72.0:15:17.49.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo has entered a state of sleep.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:24.51.0:15:25.92.Default..0.0.0..So long...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:27.17.0:15:29.59.Default..0.0.0..I slept for such a long time...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:31.10.0:15:36.80.Default..0.0.0.....that I and the other Pokémon created here...
Dialogue: 0.0:15:38.10.0:15:42.31.Default..0.0.0..Just about everything aside from sleep disappeared to me.
Dialogue: 0.0:15:43.65.0:15:45.10.Default..0.0.0.....and so...
Dialogue: 0.0:16:12.09.0:16:14.06.Default..0.0.0..Where am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:16:14.06.0:16:15.84.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:16:18.06.0:16:22.14.Default..0.0.0..I have always dreamed of this world of which I have no memories of...
Dialogue: 0.0:16:25.88.0:16:27.15.Default..0.0.0..Who are you?
Dialogue: 0.0:16:27.15.0:16:27.92.Default..0.0.0..Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0.0:16:44.92.0:16:51.42.Default..0.0.0..I could never forget that world they flew off into...
Dialogue: 0.0:17:11.32.0:17:12.89.Default..0.0.0..Where am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:13.64.0:17:15.32.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:16.03.0:17:18.57.Default..0.0.0..Who brought me here?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:31.84.0:17:33.41.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:33.97.0:17:35.33.Default..0.0.0..Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0.0:17:35.59.0:17:39.72.Default..0.0.0..No... The issue is that I am still here...
Dialogue: 0.0:17:40.27.0:17:44.26.Default..0.0.0..I still have not been born into the world...
Dialogue: 0.0:17:49.36.0:17:50.98.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?!
Dialogue: 0.0:18:00.70.0:18:02.03.Default..0.0.0..They have awakened!
Dialogue: 0.0:18:02.03.0:18:03.35.Default..0.0.0..Did they do that themselves?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:03.35.0:18:04.74.Default..0.0.0..Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0.0:18:05.37.0:18:07.74.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo is complete!
Dialogue: 0.0:18:08.96.0:18:10.62.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:11.42.0:18:12.92.Default..0.0.0..That is who you are.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:12.92.0:18:18.21.Default..0.0.0..We have brought you into existence from the Pokémon known as the rarest in the world.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:18.72.0:18:22.77.Default..0.0.0..Yes. that Pokémon is known to be the rarest in the world.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:22.77.0:18:24.05.Default..0.0.0..Mew!
Dialogue: 0.0:18:24.77.0:18:25.60.Default..0.0.0..Mew?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:27.24.0:18:29.09.Default..0.0.0..That is my parent?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:29.09.0:18:29.90.Default..0.0.0..My father?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:30.56.0:18:31.50.Default..0.0.0..My mother?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:32.11.0:18:35.15.Default..0.0.0..You could say that. but it wouldn't quite be correct.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:36.49.0:18:40.81.Default..0.0.0..You have been based on Mew. but have been created to be much stronger.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:40.81.0:18:41.64.Default..0.0.0..Who then?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:42.40.0:18:44.36.Default..0.0.0..If I have no mother and no father...
Dialogue: 0.0:18:44.36.0:18:45.82.Default..0.0.0..Does that mean it was God?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:45.82.0:18:48.35.Default..0.0.0..Did God create me?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:48.35.0:18:53.14.Default..0.0.0..Only God and humans can create life in this world.
Dialogue: 0.0:18:53.14.0:18:56.91.Default..0.0.0..So it was you... Humans created me?
Dialogue: 0.0:18:56.91.0:18:58.47.Default..0.0.0..This is a triumph for science!
Dialogue: 0.0:18:58.47.0:19:01.05.Default..0.0.0..This proves we were right!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:01.05.0:19:02.18.Default..0.0.0..We can continue the research!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:02.18.0:19:04.63.Default..0.0.0..This will be a new sacred ground!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:02.70.0:19:05.14.Default..0.0.0..No doubt they'll increase our funding!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:05.14.0:19:06.68.Default..0.0.0..The next step will be a version update!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:05.48.0:19:07.62.Default..0.0.0..I will contact the other departments.
Dialogue: 0.0:19:07.62.0:19:09.39.Default..0.0.0..The birth of a new Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:07.62.0:19:08.50.Default..0.0.0..Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0.0:19:16.49.0:19:18.19.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:20.49.0:19:22.11.Default..0.0.0..Where am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:19:23.70.0:19:26.32.Default..0.0.0..For what reason was I born?
Dialogue: 0.0:20:02.78.0:20:06.20.Default..0.0.0..To create the world's ultimate Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0.0:20:08.62.0:20:10.70.Default..0.0.0..Our dream...
Dialogue: 0.0:20:38.24.0:20:40.36.Default..0.0.0..This is my power.
Dialogue: 0.0:20:41.45.0:20:44.82.Default..0.0.0..I am the strongest Pokémon in this world.
Dialogue: 0.0:20:45.91.0:20:48.86.Default..0.0.0..Mew. am I stronger than you?
Dialogue: 0.0:20:56.46.0:21:01.05.Default..0.0.0..You may certainly be the world's strongest Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:01.05.0:21:04.55.Default..0.0.0..But there is something in this world stronger still.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:05.43.0:21:06.76.Default..0.0.0..Humans?
Dialogue: 0.0:21:09.10.0:21:11.64.Default..0.0.0..If you join forces with humans...
Dialogue: 0.0:21:11.64.0:21:14.27.Default..0.0.0..This world will belong to us.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:14.27.0:21:16.48.Default..0.0.0..The world will belong to us?
Dialogue: 0.0:21:16.48.0:21:20.28.Default..0.0.0..However if that power of yours runs wild...
Dialogue: 0.0:21:20.28.0:21:22.49.Default..0.0.0..You could just destroy this world.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:22.49.0:21:26.12.Default..0.0.0..You must control your power.
Dialogue: 0.0:21:26.12.0:21:27.49.Default..0.0.0..Control?
Dialogue: 0.0:21:27.49.0:21:32.52.Default..0.0.0..Are you fine with letting your power burn the world to nothing like this island?
Dialogue: 0.0:21:33.12.0:21:34.74.Default..0.0.0..What should I do?
Dialogue: 0.0:21:56.94.0:22:00.73.Default..0.0.0..This armour protects my body and suppresses my power.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:01.32.0:22:05.03.Default..0.0.0..What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0.0:22:05.03.0:22:06.97.Default..0.0.0..It is simple.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:06.97.0:22:10.37.Default..0.0.0..Do as everyone else has done on this planet.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:10.37.0:22:11.50.Default..0.0.0..Everyone else?
Dialogue: 0.0:22:11.50.0:22:14.64.Default..0.0.0..Fight. Destroy. Plunder.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:14.64.0:22:16.45.Default..0.0.0..The strong ones win.
Dialogue: 0.0:22:33.68.0:22:35.85.Default..0.0.0..But who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:22:56.87.0:22:58.87.Default..0.0.0..Where am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:23:25.36.0:23:28.27.Default..0.0.0..For what reason am I fighting?
Dialogue: 0.0:23:48.01.0:23:50.59.Default..0.0.0..For what reason am I alive?
Dialogue: 0.0:23:52.93.0:23:55.12.Default..0.0.0..You are a Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:55.12.0:23:59.10.Default..0.0.0..Pokémon live for humans. to be used by humans.
Dialogue: 0.0:23:59.90.0:24:02.62.Default..0.0.0..Does that mean I should fight for you?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:02.62.0:24:06.39.Default..0.0.0..Does that mean I should fight for humans?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:06.39.0:24:09.08.Default..0.0.0..You are a Pokémon created by humans.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:09.08.0:24:11.26.Default..0.0.0..What other value could you possibly have?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:11.78.0:24:13.65.Default..0.0.0..My value. you say?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:14.32.0:24:15.50.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:16.32.0:24:18.18.Default..0.0.0..For what reason am I alive?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:20.92.0:24:21.94.Default..0.0.0..What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0.0:24:23.13.0:24:25.37.Default..0.0.0..I was created by humans.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:26.09.0:24:27.75.Default..0.0.0..But I am not even human!
Dialogue: 0.0:24:29.01.0:24:30.74.Default..0.0.0..I am a Pokémon that has been created.
Dialogue: 0.0:24:30.74.0:24:32.04.Default..0.0.0..So I am not even a Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:25:11.38.0:25:12.92.Default..0.0.0..Who am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:25:13.93.0:25:15.51.Default..0.0.0..Where am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:25:16.26.0:25:18.05.Default..0.0.0..Who asked for my birth?
Dialogue: 0.0:25:18.60.0:25:20.48.Default..0.0.0..Who wished for my creation?
Dialogue: 0.0:25:21.85.0:25:24.11.Default..0.0.0..I curse everything that led to my birth.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:25.15.0:25:29.40.Default..0.0.0..So this is neither an attack nor a declaration of war.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:30.44.0:25:33.44.Default..0.0.0..It is me against you who brought me into existence.
Dialogue: 0.0:25:33.44.0:25:34.61.Default..0.0.0..I will strike back.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:16.74.0:26:21.24.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi and his friends are continuing their training journey as he aims to be a Pokémon Master.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:21.24.0:26:24.70.Default..0.0.0..The weather's nice and they're taking a short break in a field.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:27.75.0:26:29.88.Default..0.0.0..Is it ready yet. Takeshi?
Dialogue: 0.0:26:29.88.0:26:33.16.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi. you should help too!
Dialogue: 0.0:26:33.16.0:26:37.22.Default..0.0.0..I can't. I'm so hungry. I can't move a single millimetre.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:37.22.0:26:38.64.Default..0.0.0..Good grief.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:38.64.0:26:41.75.Default..0.0.0..Simmer carefully and nurture gently...
Dialogue: 0.0:26:41.75.0:26:44.14.Default..0.0.0..You can't rush soup nor Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:26:53.19.0:26:55.45.Default..0.0.0..Hey. you boy!
Dialogue: 0.0:26:55.45.0:26:59.86.Default..0.0.0..You're Satoshi. that guy from Masara Town who got eight badges. right?
Dialogue: 0.0:27:00.74.0:27:02.10.Default..0.0.0..Yeah. why?
Dialogue: 0.0:27:02.10.0:27:05.57.Default..0.0.0..Can we have a Pokémon battle?
Dialogue: 0.0:27:06.46.0:27:09.83.Default..0.0.0..Okay! I have to accept a match if you're dishing them out!
Dialogue: 0.0:27:09.83.0:27:12.55.Default..0.0.0..I thought you couldn't move a single millimetre?
Dialogue: 0.0:27:12.55.0:27:15.90.Default..0.0.0..What's one or two Pokémon battles before breakfast?
Dialogue: 0.0:27:15.90.0:27:19.09.Default..0.0.0..Technically this is lunch. you know.
Dialogue: 0.0:27:26.82.0:27:31.28.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Even through fire. through water. or through forests...
Dialogue: 0.0:27:31.28.0:27:32.82.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Through the ground. through the cloud...
Dialogue: 0.0:27:32.82.0:27:35.25.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Through that girl's skirt...
Dialogue: 0.0:27:35.25.0:27:39.00.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}It may be very. very. very. very tough. but...
Dialogue: 0.0:27:39.00.0:27:41.11.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I'll be sure to get them
Dialogue: 0.0:27:41.11.0:27:47.22.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I'll get you. Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:27:47.22.0:27:50.08.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Farewell to Masara Town. bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0.0:27:51.10.0:27:53.90.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I'm leaving on a journey with this guy
Dialogue: 0.0:27:54.92.0:27:58.92.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}We're on a winning streak with the moves we've trained
Dialogue: 0.0:27:58.92.0:28:01.01.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}We'll add some more companions...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:01.01.0:28:02.66.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}...and we're off to the next city
Dialogue: 0.0:28:02.66.0:28:06.85.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Succeeding always and forever...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:06.85.0:28:10.00.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}There's no guarantee about that
Dialogue: 0.0:28:10.62.0:28:20.54.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}But I will live true always and forever with them here
Dialogue: 0.0:28:24.90.0:28:29.06.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Even through fire. through water. or through forests...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:29.06.0:28:30.66.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Through the ground. through the cloud...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:30.66.0:28:32.50.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Through that girl's skirt...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:32.50.0:28:33.24.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}You're persistent!
Dialogue: 0.0:28:33.24.0:28:36.88.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}It may be very. very. very. very tough. but...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:36.88.0:28:38.94.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I'll be sure to get them
Dialogue: 0.0:28:38.94.0:28:45.05.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I'll get you. Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:28:45.05.0:28:47.90.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Tired from battling. time for sleep. good night
Dialogue: 0.0:28:48.94.0:28:51.64.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}When I close my eyes. I recall it...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:52.76.0:28:56.79.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}How flames burned. how the wind danced...
Dialogue: 0.0:28:56.79.0:29:00.54.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}How the cries echoed in that battle...
Dialogue: 0.0:29:00.54.0:29:04.62.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}The enemy of yesterday is the friend of today
Dialogue: 0.0:29:04.62.0:29:07.86.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}That's the old saying. but...
Dialogue: 0.0:29:08.50.0:29:12.24.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}The friend of today is also the friend of tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0.0:29:12.24.0:29:18.96.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}That's right. for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0.0:29:22.98.0:29:29.62.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}Ah. I aspire to be a Pokémon Master...
Dialogue: 0.0:29:30.70.0:29:32.67.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I want to be one!
Dialogue: 0.0:29:32.67.0:29:34.69.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fs50}I have to be one!
Dialogue: 0.0:29:34.69.0:29:40.26.Default..0.0.0..{\c&H00D8FF&\3c&H054D8B&\fnNirmala UI\fad(0.210)\fs50}I know I'll be one!
Dialogue: 0.0:29:49.83.0:29:51.78.Default..0.0.0..Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0.0:29:52.29.0:29:53.57.Default..0.0.0..We did it!
Dialogue: 0.0:29:54.92.0:29:57.41.Default..0.0.0..They were just a weak opponent.
Dialogue: 0.0:29:57.41.0:29:59.83.Default..0.0.0..Insufficient raising.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:05.80.0:30:08.93.Default..0.0.0..Every time Pikachu just polishes up shinier than before.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:08.93.0:30:10.35.Default..0.0.0..Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:10.35.0:30:13.10.Default..0.0.0..We hyaven't had a single win.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:13.10.0:30:17.88.Default..0.0.0..Byut gyiving up is not in our dictionary.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:17.88.0:30:20.72.Default..0.0.0..We'll have that Pikachu no matter what.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:20.72.0:30:23.00.Default..0.0.0..But look at that.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:27.16.0:30:29.38.Default..0.0.0..I'm hyungry.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:29.38.0:30:31.29.Default..0.0.0..I have the frying pan.
Dialogue: 0.0:30:31.29.0:30:35.37.Default..0.0.0..Nyat's just an iron slab without any meat or vegetables.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:05.24.0:31:08.73.Default..0.0.0..Master. should I send them an invitation as well?
Dialogue: 0.0:31:10.66.0:31:12.32.Default..0.0.0..Certainly.
Dialogue: 0.0:31:46.07.0:31:47.86.Default..0.0.0..What's with you?
Dialogue: 0.0:31:49.78.0:31:51.32.Default..0.0.0..Is this for me?
Dialogue: 0.0:31:57.83.0:32:00.91.Default..0.0.0..Please excuse this sudden message.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:00.91.0:32:03.09.Default..0.0.0..What a beautiful lady...
Dialogue: 0.0:32:03.09.0:32:06.75.Default..0.0.0..You have been identified as Pokémon trainers with a promising future.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:07.42.0:32:13.39.Default..0.0.0..My Master. the ultimate Pokémon trainer. formally invites you to a party.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:13.39.0:32:17.41.Default..0.0.0..The location is Pokémon Castle on New Island.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:17.41.0:32:22.10.Default..0.0.0..Please place a check on the reply postcard if you will be attending.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:22.94.0:32:27.94.Default..0.0.0..By all means. please accept the invitation from the ultimate Pokémon trainer.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:31.86.0:32:34.49.Default..0.0.0..Oh. the beautiful lady...
Dialogue: 0.0:32:34.49.0:32:35.49.Default..0.0.0..What should we do?
Dialogue: 0.0:32:35.49.0:32:38.27.Default..0.0.0..Participate! We have to participate!
Dialogue: 0.0:32:38.27.0:32:41.62.Default..0.0.0..It doesn't feel half bad to be told that you have a promising future.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:42.79.0:32:45.25.Default..0.0.0..Then let's check yes on the postcard.
Dialogue: 0.0:32:45.25.0:32:46.12.Default..0.0.0..Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0.0:32:56.97.0:33:01.01.Default..0.0.0..You don't think you can have that intense bye-bye without greeting us first. do you?
Dialogue: 0.0:33:05.48.0:33:07.81.Default..0.0.0..Oh? A postcard?
Dialogue: 0.0:34:54.80.0:34:56.59.Default..0.0.0..Calm down. Come on. calm down.
Dialogue: 0.0:34:56.59.0:34:59.17.Default..0.0.0..Cut it out. Kingler!
Dialogue: 0.0:35:10.58.0:35:12.61.Default..0.0.0..The weather was so nice too.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:12.61.0:35:15.44.Default..0.0.0..Coastal weather sure changes easily.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:19.76.0:35:20.42.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.0:35:21.00.0:35:23.06.Default..0.0.0..The ferry's cancelled?
Dialogue: 0.0:35:23.06.0:35:24.74.Default..0.0.0..We can't go to New Island?
Dialogue: 0.0:35:24.74.0:35:25.96.Default..0.0.0..No way!
Dialogue: 0.0:35:25.96.0:35:27.92.Default..0.0.0..We were invited and everything!
Dialogue: 0.0:35:27.92.0:35:29.88.Default..0.0.0..Quiet down. everybody.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:29.88.0:35:32.51.Default..0.0.0..This woman here manages this wharf.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:32.51.0:35:34.32.Default..0.0.0..I am Voyager.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:34.32.0:35:38.18.Default..0.0.0..If you wish to know the sea. ask the wharfside seagulls.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:38.18.0:35:41.68.Default..0.0.0..You don't even need to ask. just look at the whirling clouds.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:41.68.0:35:44.10.Default..0.0.0..I have never witnessed a hurricane like this.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:44.10.0:35:46.37.Default..0.0.0..Is it that intense?
Dialogue: 0.0:35:46.37.0:35:50.55.Default..0.0.0..I grew up by a port. and even I have never experienced a storm like this.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:50.55.0:35:54.82.Default..0.0.0..Worse still. the storm is in the skies over the coast of New Island.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:54.82.0:35:58.63.Default..0.0.0..I cannot allow you all to suffer through such danger.
Dialogue: 0.0:35:58.63.0:36:01.99.Default..0.0.0..I am the guardian of this harbour and that is my wish.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:01.99.0:36:05.00.Default..0.0.0..So that means the ferry is cancelled.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:05.00.0:36:07.50.Default..0.0.0..Whatever. it's fine. I have my Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0.0:36:07.50.0:36:11.83.Default..0.0.0..My Pokémon is strong in the water. we'll cross that sea!
Dialogue: 0.0:36:11.83.0:36:13.09.Default..0.0.0..Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:13.09.0:36:15.66.Default..0.0.0..I know the sea and I'm telling you it's a no-go.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:16.17.0:36:19.51.Default..0.0.0..She's right. Besides. if your Pokémon get injured...
Dialogue: 0.0:36:19.51.0:36:22.77.Default..0.0.0..You won't be able to cure them at the Pokémon Centre right away.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:22.77.0:36:24.40.Default..0.0.0..What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0.0:36:24.40.0:36:28.02.Default..0.0.0..Nurse Joi from the Pokémon Centre has gone missing.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:28.02.0:36:31.33.Default..0.0.0..We cannot treat Pokémon injuries without Nurse Joi.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:31.33.0:36:33.77.Default..0.0.0..That is the police search poster for her.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:35.90.0:36:37.32.Default..0.0.0..Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0.0:36:37.32.0:36:38.30.Default..0.0.0..Huh?
Dialogue: 0.0:36:38.30.0:36:40.52.Default..0.0.0..I've seen her somewhere...
Dialogue: 0.0:36:56.22.0:36:57.24.Default..0.0.0..Here we go!
Dialogue: 0.0:36:58.62.0:36:59.83.Default..0.0.0..Stop this!
Dialogue: 0.0:36:59.83.0:37:01.72.Default..0.0.0..If you do not stop. I will have to arrest you!
Dialogue: 0.0:37:07.06.0:37:09.09.Default..0.0.0..It was impossible to stop them after all.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:10.39.0:37:13.03.Default..0.0.0..Those children are Pokémon trainers...
Dialogue: 0.0:37:13.03.0:37:14.83.Default..0.0.0..Adventurers.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:14.83.0:37:18.94.Default..0.0.0..If they were the sort of children to quit after being told no. they would never have gathered here.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:23.07.0:37:24.90.Default..0.0.0..Let us pray they will be safe.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:32.50.0:37:35.96.Default..0.0.0..The ultimate trainer is across this sea!
Dialogue: 0.0:37:35.96.0:37:38.29.Default..0.0.0..We can't pull out now!
Dialogue: 0.0:37:39.42.0:37:43.93.Default..0.0.0..But we don't have Pokémon that can cross a stormy sea.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:43.93.0:37:45.09.Default..0.0.0..You're right.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:51.10.0:37:53.02.Default..0.0.0..You seem stuck.
Dialogue: 0.0:37:53.02.0:37:55.69.Default..0.0.0..How about it? I'm not saying it'll be free...
Dialogue: 0.0:37:55.69.0:37:59.44.Default..0.0.0..But under the circumstances. we could ferry you across.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:10.49.0:38:12.79.Default..0.0.0..We've been sent a life raft. as they say.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:12.79.0:38:15.15.Default..0.0.0..We've gotten lucky.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:15.15.0:38:18.45.Default..0.0.0..But will a boat like this really be safe?
Dialogue: 0.0:38:19.63.0:38:22.01.Default..0.0.0..Even waves like this are fine with us...
Dialogue: 0.0:38:22.01.0:38:26.39.Default..0.0.0..We took our first baths as newborns in the raging waves of Guren Strait.
Dialogue: 0.0:38:26.39.0:38:28.42.Default..0.0.0..What are they nyon about?
Dialogue: 0.0:38:33.64.0:38:36.26.Default..0.0.0..Togepi. stay still a little while longer. okay?
Dialogue: 0.0:38:55.94.0:38:56.81.Default..0.0.0..You!
Dialogue: 0.0:38:56.81.0:38:58.17.Default..0.0.0..You guys!
Dialogue: 0.0:38:58.17.0:39:00.67.Default..0.0.0..We should have expected you to pop up here!
Dialogue: 0.0:39:00.67.0:39:02.16.Default..0.0.0..What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0.0:39:02.71.0:39:04.92.Default..0.0.0..No matter what you ask...
Dialogue: 0.0:39:04.92.0:39:06.42.Default..0.0.0..The mercy of the world is...
Dialogue: 0.0:39:06.42.0:39:08.88.Default..0.0.0..Thyis is nyot the time for that!
Dialogue: 0.0:39:21.44.0:39:22.57.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.0:39:22.57.0:39:23.80.Default..0.0.0..Kasumi!
Dialogue: 0.0:39:27.80.0:39:29.45.Default..0.0.0..Where are Satoshi and Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0.0:39:29.45.0:39:30.53.Default..0.0.0..I don't know!
Dialogue: 0.0:39:38.04.0:39:40.49.Default..0.0.0..Everyone. hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0.0:40:57.64.0:40:58.52.Default..0.0.0..That must be...
Dialogue: 0.0:41:38.74.0:41:40.94.Default..0.0.0..Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:41.50.0:41:43.40.Default..0.0.0..Please present your invitation.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:45.67.0:41:46.70.Default..0.0.0..This thing?
Dialogue: 0.0:41:48.84.0:41:52.29.Default..0.0.0..These people are confirmed to be invited guests.
Dialogue: 0.0:41:53.54.0:41:56.14.Default..0.0.0..It really is you. isn't it?
Dialogue: 0.0:41:56.14.0:41:57.05.Default..0.0.0..Pardon?
Dialogue: 0.0:41:59.10.0:42:02.06.Default..0.0.0..You're the Nurse Joi seen on the wharf police search poster.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:02.06.0:42:04.19.Default..0.0.0..Now that you mention it. they do look similar.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:04.19.0:42:05.97.Default..0.0.0..What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0.0:42:05.97.0:42:10.06.Default..0.0.0..I have been in service of this castle since I was born.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:10.65.0:42:12.94.Default..0.0.0..Now. come along this way.
Dialogue: 0.0:42:13.65.0:42:17.69.Default..0.0.0..The other invited guests have already gathered.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:42.87.0:43:47.28.Default..0.0.0..Over there. you will find all the trainers that have already arrived.
Dialogue: 0.0:43:54.52.0:43:55.93.Default..0.0.0..Only three?
Dialogue: 0.0:43:55.93.0:43:58.50.Default..0.0.0..Even though so many were invited?
Dialogue: 0.0:43:58.50.0:44:04.01.Default..0.0.0..It cannot be helped that some trainers could not surmount the storm despite being invited.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:04.01.0:44:07.02.Default..0.0.0..Are you saying that storm was a test?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:07.02.0:44:10.68.Default..0.0.0..Please release your Pokémon from\N their Monster Balls and sit down.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:11.65.0:44:14.77.Default..0.0.0..You are the chosen trainers.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:24.41.0:44:27.97.Default..0.0.0..So to sneak into the castle now...
Dialogue: 0.0:44:27.97.0:44:30.00.Default..0.0.0..We'll have to enter from the exit...
Dialogue: 0.0:44:30.00.0:44:31.75.Default..0.0.0..Where is the exit?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:31.75.0:44:32.54.Default..0.0.0..Over there.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:37.60.0:44:41.76.Default..0.0.0..Ew! The drainage? Dyo I lyook like a common rat?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:41.76.0:44:43.34.Default..0.0.0..No complaining.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:49.82.0:44:51.26.Default..0.0.0..What's the matter. Musashi?
Dialogue: 0.0:44:51.26.0:44:52.19.Default..0.0.0..Nothing.
Dialogue: 0.0:44:52.19.0:44:53.62.Default..0.0.0..Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:06.03.0:45:07.40.Default..0.0.0..So you made it here?
Dialogue: 0.0:45:08.66.0:45:09.60.Default..0.0.0..It's you...
Dialogue: 0.0:45:10.12.0:45:11.90.Default..0.0.0..I flew here.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:12.58.0:45:16.04.Default..0.0.0..My Pigeot made it through the hurricane in one flight.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:16.55.0:45:18.07.Default..0.0.0..Say hello. everyone.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:24.55.0:45:25.79.Default..0.0.0..That's a...
Dialogue: 0.0:45:25.79.0:45:27.55.Default..0.0.0..My Gyaradosu.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:28.06.0:45:30.57.Default..0.0.0..I weathered the sea riding on their back.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:30.57.0:45:33.14.Default..0.0.0..Those waves were nothing to them!
Dialogue: 0.0:45:33.14.0:45:34.27.Default..0.0.0..Gyaradosu?
Dialogue: 0.0:45:34.27.0:45:36.30.Default..0.0.0..Gyaradosu is the Atrocious Pokémon. right?
Dialogue: 0.0:45:36.30.0:45:37.40.Default..0.0.0..That's right.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:37.40.0:45:40.52.Default..0.0.0..There's none more reliable if you can master them.
Dialogue: 0.0:45:43.07.0:45:45.78.Default..0.0.0..My Pokémon are these ones.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:08.56.0:46:11.13.Default..0.0.0..Thank you for waiting. everyone.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:11.64.0:46:15.06.Default..0.0.0..The ultimate Pokémon trainer will now arrive.
Dialogue: 0.0:46:27.45.0:46:28.49.Default..0.0.0..That's...
Dialogue: 0.0:47:16.25.0:47:20.59.Default..0.0.0..Yes. The one before you is the ultimate Pokémon trainer...
Dialogue: 0.0:47:20.59.0:47:23.19.Default..0.0.0.....and the ultimate Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:23.19.0:47:24.88.Default..0.0.0..Master Mewtwo.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:28.05.0:47:30.01.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo?
Dialogue: 0.0:47:31.68.0:47:33.86.Default..0.0.0..A Pokémon that's a Pokémon trainer?
Dialogue: 0.0:47:33.86.0:47:34.99.Default..0.0.0..That's nonsense!
Dialogue: 0.0:47:34.99.0:47:36.39.Default..0.0.0..Why can't it be so?
Dialogue: 0.0:47:36.98.0:47:39.49.Default..0.0.0..I will set my own rules.
Dialogue: 0.0:47:39.49.0:47:40.73.Default..0.0.0..Their voice...
Dialogue: 0.0:47:40.73.0:47:42.18.Default..0.0.0..Telepathy?
Dialogue: 0.0:48:05.96.0:48:07.38.Default..0.0.0..Mindpower.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:07.38.0:48:09.04.Default..0.0.0..Go. Gyaradosu!
Dialogue: 0.0:48:13.35.0:48:15.05.Default..0.0.0..Gyaradosu. Destruction Beam!
Dialogue: 0.0:48:31.66.0:48:32.82.Default..0.0.0..Gyaradosu!
Dialogue: 0.0:48:34.83.0:48:36.32.Default..0.0.0..How trifling.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:37.29.0:48:39.03.Default..0.0.0..You are no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0.0:48:49.26.0:48:50.28.Default..0.0.0..Nurse Joi...
Dialogue: 0.0:48:51.02.0:48:52.67.Default..0.0.0..Where am I?
Dialogue: 0.0:48:52.67.0:48:55.09.Default..0.0.0..How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0.0:48:55.64.0:49:00.26.Default..0.0.0..I brought you from the Pokémon Centre to aid me.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:01.10.0:49:04.56.Default..0.0.0..A physician with detailed knowledge of Pokémon anatomy is of great use.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:05.11.0:49:07.02.Default..0.0.0..You have been very helpful.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:07.69.0:49:10.49.Default..0.0.0..You probably do not remember anything.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:10.49.0:49:11.83.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.0:49:11.83.0:49:16.97.Default..0.0.0..With the powers I possess. I can control humans like you however I see fit.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:16.97.0:49:18.32.Default..0.0.0..That's cruel!
Dialogue: 0.0:49:22.79.0:49:24.70.Default..0.0.0..There we go.
Dialogue: 0.0:49:48.02.0:49:49.30.Default..0.0.0..What nyis this place?
Dialogue: 0.0:49:58.66.0:50:00.93.Default..0.0.0..It's sort nyof cute...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:00.93.0:50:02.82.Default..0.0.0..Cute?!
Dialogue: 0.0:50:07.17.0:50:09.66.Default..0.0.0..I get the feeling there isn't any treasure here.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:10.68.0:50:11.56.Default..0.0.0..Oh well...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:18.01.0:50:20.81.Default..0.0.0..This is... our... research...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:20.81.0:50:24.99.Default..0.0.0..This is... an overview... of the machine that... makes Pokémon copies...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:24.99.0:50:28.40.Default..0.0.0..For the copies... Pokémon genes...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:28.40.0:50:30.36.Default..0.0.0..For that... samples... are required...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:30.36.0:50:31.69.Default..0.0.0..Whyat? Whyat's gyoing on?
Dialogue: 0.0:50:31.69.0:50:34.98.Default..0.0.0..Whyat? Whyat?
Dialogue: 0.0:50:37.54.0:50:38.30.Default..0.0.0..Nyarth!
Dialogue: 0.0:50:38.98.0:50:40.54.Default..0.0.0..Save mye!
Dialogue: 0.0:50:47.06.0:50:48.38.Default..0.0.0..My fyur!
Dialogue: 0.0:50:48.38.0:50:50.00.Default..0.0.0..My fyur!
Dialogue: 0.0:50:51.90.0:50:52.88.Default..0.0.0..Three strands of fur.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:52.88.0:50:55.11.Default..0.0.0..A small quantity is sufficient.
Dialogue: 0.0:50:55.11.0:50:57.94.Default..0.0.0..By examining the composition of the Pokémon of interest...
Dialogue: 0.0:50:57.94.0:51:01.39.Default..0.0.0..A copy of the original Pokémon can be created.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:01.39.0:51:02.81.Default..0.0.0..Who's that?
Dialogue: 0.0:51:02.81.0:51:03.93.Default..0.0.0..Nyarth!
Dialogue: 0.0:51:13.69.0:51:15.12.Default..0.0.0..Nyarth?
Dialogue: 0.0:51:15.12.0:51:16.91.Default..0.0.0..I'm Nyarth thyough!
Dialogue: 0.0:51:16.91.0:51:18.24.Default..0.0.0..Then this must be...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:18.24.0:51:19.87.Default..0.0.0..A copy of Nyarth?
Dialogue: 0.0:51:19.87.0:51:20.76.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.0:51:22.33.0:51:26.58.Default..0.0.0..However a copy... we created was... beyond our imagination...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:26.58.0:51:30.50.Default..0.0.0..A Legendary Pokémon was... discovered... deep within the...  ju...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:30.50.0:51:32.25.Default..0.0.0..Their name is... Mew.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:33.59.0:51:36.97.Default..0.0.0..We successfully... located a fossilised... Mew eyelash...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:36.97.0:51:40.10.Default..0.0.0..From the composition... of that Pokémon we brought back...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:40.10.0:51:44.33.Default..0.0.0..We created... Mewtwo... from this machine...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:44.33.0:51:47.75.Default..0.0.0..To create... the world's strongest... Pokémon in this way...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:47.75.0:51:49.74.Default..0.0.0..That was... our dream...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:49.74.0:51:50.72.Default..0.0.0..However...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:51.44.0:51:54.73.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo exhibited... ferocious behaviour...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:54.73.0:51:56.80.Default..0.0.0..It's already over.
Dialogue: 0.0:51:56.80.0:51:59.57.Default..0.0.0..This laboratory... will just be... destroyed...
Dialogue: 0.0:51:59.57.0:52:03.95.Default..0.0.0..The only option... is to abandon this place and flee...
Dialogue: 0.0:52:06.83.0:52:09.27.Default..0.0.0..Do they mean the laboratory by this place?
Dialogue: 0.0:52:09.27.0:52:10.46.Default..0.0.0..I think so.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:10.46.0:52:11.79.Default..0.0.0..Nyeah.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:11.79.0:52:12.79.Default..0.0.0..Yeah...
Dialogue: 0.0:52:13.34.0:52:16.13.Default..0.0.0..But it doesn't seem destroyed...
Dialogue: 0.0:52:16.13.0:52:18.27.Default..0.0.0..Maybe someone rebuilt it?
Dialogue: 0.0:52:18.27.0:52:19.62.Default..0.0.0..But who would?
Dialogue: 0.0:52:23.68.0:52:27.89.Default..0.0.0..I once thought I could work with you humans...
Dialogue: 0.0:52:27.89.0:52:30.14.Default..0.0.0..But I was disappointed.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:30.14.0:52:34.17.Default..0.0.0..Humans are the lowest creatures. inferior to Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:34.17.0:52:38.99.Default..0.0.0..If weak and cruel creatures like you humans rule...
Dialogue: 0.0:52:38.99.0:52:42.15.Default..0.0.0..This planet is doomed.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:42.15.0:52:47.14.Default..0.0.0..So you're saying that Pokémon like you should rule the planet?
Dialogue: 0.0:52:47.14.0:52:48.66.Default..0.0.0..Pokémon cannot.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:49.21.0:52:53.84.Default..0.0.0..For this planet is already ruled by humans.
Dialogue: 0.0:52:53.84.0:52:56.83.Default..0.0.0..There are even Pokémon who live for humans.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:00.18.0:53:01.66.Default..0.0.0..What was that?
Dialogue: 0.0:53:01.66.0:53:03.55.Default..0.0.0..You are saying you are not subservient?
Dialogue: 0.0:53:04.18.0:53:06.59.Default..0.0.0..You are with your trainer because you love him?
Dialogue: 0.0:53:07.93.0:53:10.80.Default..0.0.0..Just being with him alone was a grave error.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:18.57.0:53:19.96.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu...
Dialogue: 0.0:53:19.96.0:53:22.76.Default..0.0.0..It is weak Pokémon that nestle close to humans.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:23.27.0:53:25.24.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi. are you okay?
Dialogue: 0.0:53:25.24.0:53:26.37.Default..0.0.0..Yeah.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:26.37.0:53:28.36.Default..0.0.0..How dare you do that to Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.0:53:28.91.0:53:30.33.Default..0.0.0..No matter what kind of Pokémon you are...
Dialogue: 0.0:53:30.33.0:53:32.54.Default..0.0.0..If you're a Pokémon. I should be able to get you!
Dialogue: 0.0:53:32.54.0:53:34.62.Default..0.0.0..Go. my Saihorn!
Dialogue: 0.0:53:55.98.0:53:57.27.Default..0.0.0..Saihorn!
Dialogue: 0.0:53:58.07.0:53:59.39.Default..0.0.0..It is futile.
Dialogue: 0.0:53:59.39.0:54:04.43.Default..0.0.0..I was born stronger than every other Pokémon on this planet.
Dialogue: 0.0:54:04.43.0:54:07.05.Default..0.0.0..We won't know unless we try!
Dialogue: 0.0:54:07.05.0:54:08.83.Default..0.0.0..Will you try?
Dialogue: 0.0:54:08.83.0:54:09.90.Default..0.0.0..That's what I was hoping for!
Dialogue: 0.0:54:27.97.0:54:29.76.Default..0.0.0..This feels scary!
Dialogue: 0.0:55:17.48.0:55:18.09.Default..0.0.0..They cried?
Dialogue: 0.0:55:18.09.0:55:18.70.Default..0.0.0..They flew?
Dialogue: 0.0:55:18.70.0:55:19.89.Default..0.0.0..Mew?
Dialogue: 0.0:55:22.11.0:55:26.55.Default..0.0.0..Any human who aims to be a Pokémon trainer firstly obtains one of...
Dialogue: 0.0:55:26.55.0:55:27.66.Default..0.0.0..Hitokage...
Dialogue: 0.0:55:27.66.0:55:28.73.Default..0.0.0..Zenigame...
Dialogue: 0.0:55:28.73.0:55:30.10.Default..0.0.0..Or Fushigidane...
Dialogue: 0.0:55:30.91.0:55:35.79.Default..0.0.0..These are copies of their evolved forms that I have created.
Dialogue: 0.0:55:35.79.0:55:37.12.Default..0.0.0..Copies?
Dialogue: 0.0:55:37.12.0:55:38.20.Default..0.0.0..Those are?
Dialogue: 0.0:56:05.36.0:56:06.69.Default..0.0.0..An arena?
Dialogue: 0.0:56:06.69.0:56:09.17.Default..0.0.0..Does this mean a Pokémon battle?
Dialogue: 0.0:56:09.17.0:56:11.53.Default..0.0.0..My Fushigibana. Banard. is here!
Dialogue: 0.0:56:14.41.0:56:17.28.Default..0.0.0..I have my Kamex. Couxcoux. here.
Dialogue: 0.0:56:19.29.0:56:21.69.Default..0.0.0.....and I've got my Lizardon here!
Dialogue: 0.0:56:21.69.0:56:23.71.Default..0.0.0..Lizardon. I choose you!
Dialogue: 0.0:56:35.89.0:56:38.30.Default..0.0.0..Lizardon. that's a surprise attack...
Dialogue: 0.0:56:46.48.0:56:49.36.Default..0.0.0..This Lizardon is extremely lacking in discipline.
Dialogue: 0.0:57:07.09.0:57:09.58.Default..0.0.0..Who will be the first opponent?
Dialogue: 0.0:57:15.72.0:57:18.62.Default..0.0.0..I wasn't prepared earlier. but that won't happen this time!
Dialogue: 0.0:57:34.86.0:57:36.15.Default..0.0.0..Go. Banard!
Dialogue: 0.0:57:36.15.0:57:37.65.Default..0.0.0..Leaf Cutter!
Dialogue: 0.0:57:38.79.0:57:40.11.Default..0.0.0..Vine Whip.
Dialogue: 0.0:57:55.26.0:57:56.42.Default..0.0.0..Banard!
Dialogue: 0.0:57:57.31.0:57:58.56.Default..0.0.0..I'm up next!
Dialogue: 0.0:57:58.56.0:58:00.43.Default..0.0.0..Go forth. Couxcoux!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:05.61.0:58:07.27.Default..0.0.0..Couxcoux. Hydro Pump!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:14.95.0:58:16.28.Default..0.0.0..Couxcoux!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:16.91.0:58:18.53.Default..0.0.0..Be careful. Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:18.53.0:58:20.71.Default..0.0.0..Their moves are really powerful!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:20.71.0:58:21.82.Default..0.0.0..I know!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:27.25.0:58:28.34.Default..0.0.0..Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:28.34.0:58:30.67.Default..0.0.0..We'll make this a match in speed instead of power!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:32.17.0:58:33.71.Default..0.0.0..All right. go!
Dialogue: 0.0:58:48.02.0:58:49.94.Default..0.0.0..What part of that is a match in speed?
Dialogue: 0.0:58:49.94.0:58:51.52.Default..0.0.0..The opponent is too fast!
Dialogue: 0.0:59:11.80.0:59:12.80.Default..0.0.0..Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0.0:59:12.80.0:59:14.25.Default..0.0.0..Globe Throw!
Dialogue: 0.0:59:27.23.0:59:29.11.Default..0.0.0..Hang in there. Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0.0:59:29.11.0:59:30.10.Default..0.0.0..Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:30.69.0:59:33.27.Default..0.0.0..Insufficient speed and power.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:39.66.0:59:40.52.Default..0.0.0..Stop!
Dialogue: 0.0:59:45.62.0:59:47.72.Default..0.0.0..Are you planning on taking people's Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:47.72.0:59:48.71.Default..0.0.0..Take?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:48.71.0:59:54.46.Default..0.0.0..No. I will create copies far stronger than the Pokémon you have so much pride in.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:54.46.0:59:55.94.Default..0.0.0..Ones worthy of me.
Dialogue: 0.0:59:56.59.0:59:57.59.Default..0.0.0..Copies?
Dialogue: 0.0:59:58.13.1:00:00.39.Default..0.0.0..Stop! That's foul play!
Dialogue: 0.1:00:00.39.1:00:02.26.Default..0.0.0..Don't give me orders!
Dialogue: 0.1:00:07.10.1:00:09.68.Default..0.0.0..I will set my own rules.
Dialogue: 0.1:00:11.27.1:00:12.19.Default..0.0.0..They're coming!
Dialogue: 0.1:00:12.19.1:00:13.35.Default..0.0.0..Everyone. run!
Dialogue: 0.1:00:21.20.1:00:22.53.Default..0.0.0..Gyaradosu!
Dialogue: 0.1:00:27.46.1:00:28.45.Default..0.0.0..Stop!
Dialogue: 0.1:01:00.64.1:01:01.60.Default..0.0.0..I know!
Dialogue: 0.1:01:01.60.1:01:05.97.Default..0.0.0..Everyone. return your Pokémon to their own Monster Balls!
Dialogue: 0.1:01:05.97.1:01:08.03.Default..0.0.0..Return. Zenigame! Fushigidane!
Dialogue: 0.1:01:10.33.1:01:11.20.Default..0.0.0..Futile.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:16.17.1:01:20.00.Default..0.0.0..Nothing is impossible for the Monster Balls I have created.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:20.55.1:01:21.78.Default..0.0.0..We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:21.78.1:01:22.88.Default..0.0.0..We have to get outside.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:25.72.1:01:27.01.Default..0.0.0..My Koduck.
Dialogue: 0.1:01:28.82.1:01:29.58.Default..0.0.0..Rokon!
Dialogue: 0.1:01:37.48.1:01:38.94.Default..0.0.0..Run away. Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:01:54.50.1:01:55.79.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:02:06.60.1:02:08.05.Default..0.0.0..Don't give in. Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:02:34.70.1:02:35.66.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:02:51.06.1:02:52.36.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:03:11.41.1:03:13.91.Default..0.0.0..PIKACHU!
Dialogue: 0.1:03:20.92.1:03:22.08.Default..0.0.0..Who's that?
Dialogue: 0.1:03:22.96.1:03:24.50.Default..0.0.0..Strike.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:25.55.1:03:26.92.Default..0.0.0..Dugong.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:28.18.1:03:29.42.Default..0.0.0..Rafflesia.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:33.64.1:03:35.10.Default..0.0.0..Sandpan.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:35.10.1:03:36.51.Default..0.0.0..Needoqueen.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:36.51.1:03:37.97.Default..0.0.0..Showers.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:38.48.1:03:41.93.Default..0.0.0..So nyis ryeally is Nyarth.
Dialogue: 0.1:03:49.16.1:03:50.46.Default..0.0.0..The brat-boy!
Dialogue: 0.1:03:50.46.1:03:51.99.Default..0.0.0..The Rocket Gang...
Dialogue: 0.1:03:51.99.1:03:54.64.Default..0.0.0..Sorry. I don't have the time today for you.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:00.04.1:04:01.74.Default..0.0.0..Who's that?
Dialogue: 0.1:04:01.74.1:04:03.57.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu.
Dialogue: 0.1:04:03.57.1:04:05.46.Default..0.0.0..Damn it!
Dialogue: 0.1:04:05.46.1:04:06.97.Default..0.0.0..Hey you. let go!
Dialogue: 0.1:04:06.97.1:04:09.84.Default..0.0.0..Let go of my Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:04:09.84.1:04:11.51.Default..0.0.0..Let go!
Dialogue: 0.1:04:16.27.1:04:17.47.Default..0.0.0..Whyat's happening?
Dialogue: 0.1:04:27.74.1:04:28.78.Default..0.0.0..Come on...
Dialogue: 0.1:04:36.24.1:04:37.28.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu?
Dialogue: 0.1:04:50.01.1:04:52.17.Default..0.0.0..So many copies!
Dialogue: 0.1:05:00.72.1:05:02.51.Default..0.0.0..Oh my... Here they come...
Dialogue: 0.1:05:02.51.1:05:04.36.Default..0.0.0..My copy tyoo...
Dialogue: 0.1:05:04.36.1:05:06.22.Default..0.0.0..They're all copies?
Dialogue: 0.1:05:11.24.1:05:13.03.Default..0.0.0..Oh. the copies...
Dialogue: 0.1:05:13.03.1:05:14.24.Default..0.0.0..Whyere are they gyoing?
Dialogue: 0.1:05:26.48.1:05:28.00.Default..0.0.0..Oh my. here come the real ones too!
Dialogue: 0.1:05:35.26.1:05:36.28.Default..0.0.0..Zenigame!
Dialogue: 0.1:05:42.20.1:05:43.38.Default..0.0.0..Fushigidane!
Dialogue: 0.1:06:17.10.1:06:18.89.Default..0.0.0..Humans...
Dialogue: 0.1:06:18.89.1:06:21.59.Default..0.0.0..I will not take your lives.
Dialogue: 0.1:06:21.59.1:06:23.26.Default..0.0.0..You may leave... Immediately...
Dialogue: 0.1:06:31.86.1:06:34.77.Default..0.0.0..If you can go back through the storm...
Dialogue: 0.1:06:47.29.1:06:48.29.Default..0.0.0..What is this?
Dialogue: 0.1:06:57.01.1:06:58.85.Default..0.0.0..Unforgivable...
Dialogue: 0.1:06:58.85.1:07:00.84.Default..0.0.0..You are unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:05.66.1:07:06.62.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:06.62.1:07:07.70.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:18.02.1:07:19.00.Default..0.0.0..Koduck!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:19.00.1:07:19.92.Default..0.0.0..Rokon!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:24.21.1:07:26.12.Default..0.0.0..You set them free?
Dialogue: 0.1:07:26.12.1:07:28.72.Default..0.0.0..My Pokémon...
Dialogue: 0.1:07:28.72.1:07:30.37.Default..0.0.0..My companions...
Dialogue: 0.1:07:31.13.1:07:32.21.Default..0.0.0..I will protect them!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:44.50.1:07:45.30.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:45.30.1:07:46.01.Default..0.0.0..Stop!
Dialogue: 0.1:07:53.23.1:07:54.10.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:02.08.1:08:03.28.Default..0.0.0..You are...
Dialogue: 0.1:08:18.80.1:08:20.17.Default..0.0.0..Over there?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:26.60.1:08:27.93.Default..0.0.0..Is that...
Dialogue: 0.1:08:27.93.1:08:29.22.Default..0.0.0.....a Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:30.56.1:08:31.93.Default..0.0.0..Mew.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:31.93.1:08:35.04.Default..0.0.0..The Pokémon called the rarest in the world.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:35.04.1:08:35.98.Default..0.0.0..Mew?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:37.61.1:08:40.44.Default..0.0.0..I may have been created from you...
Dialogue: 0.1:08:41.03.1:08:43.80.Default..0.0.0..But I am stronger.
Dialogue: 0.1:08:43.80.1:08:46.45.Default..0.0.0..I am the real one!
Dialogue: 0.1:08:48.29.1:08:50.36.Default..0.0.0..Mew and Mewtwo...
Dialogue: 0.1:08:50.36.1:08:52.75.Default..0.0.0..Mewtwo was created from Mew?
Dialogue: 0.1:08:55.96.1:08:58.13.Default..0.0.0..I will be the only one to survive!
Dialogue: 0.1:09:10.26.1:09:11.95.Default..0.0.0..Why won't you battle?
Dialogue: 0.1:09:11.95.1:09:14.73.Default..0.0.0..Do you avoid battle out of fear?
Dialogue: 0.1:09:49.56.1:09:52.85.Default..0.0.0..It seems you are an opponent who can at least resist!
Dialogue: 0.1:09:55.02.1:09:57.72.Default..0.0.0..We will now settle which of us is the real one!
Dialogue: 0.1:09:58.72.1:10:01.32.Default..0.0.0..Which is stronger? Mew or myself?
Dialogue: 0.1:10:01.32.1:10:04.78.Default..0.0.0..Are we stronger than you originals?
Dialogue: 0.1:10:07.62.1:10:11.41.Default..0.0.0..We were created to be stronger than the real ones.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:17.13.1:10:18.96.Default..0.0.0..I shee...
Dialogue: 0.1:10:18.96.1:10:19.87.Default..0.0.0..What are they saying?
Dialogue: 0.1:10:20.42.1:10:21.88.Default..0.0.0..The real ones are the real ones.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:21.88.1:10:24.55.Default..0.0.0..If nyou strike body against body without using any moves...
Dialogue: 0.1:10:24.55.1:10:27.97.Default..0.0.0..The real ones wyould not lose to the copies. Nyat's what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:29.81.1:10:32.89.Default..0.0.0..The real ones are the real ones. you say?
Dialogue: 0.1:10:44.78.1:10:45.99.Default..0.0.0..Very well then.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:45.99.1:10:48.82.Default..0.0.0..We will settle who are the real ones without any moves.
Dialogue: 0.1:10:49.37.1:10:51.45.Default..0.0.0..We are the strong ones!
Dialogue: 0.1:10:52.00.1:10:52.82.Default..0.0.0..Go!
Dialogue: 0.1:13:30.45.1:13:33.08.Default..0.0.0..What is this battle?
Dialogue: 0.1:13:33.08.1:13:36.07.Default..0.0.0..Real ones... Copies...
Dialogue: 0.1:13:36.70.1:13:38.41.Default..0.0.0..They're all alive right now!
Dialogue: 0.1:13:38.95.1:13:41.24.Default..0.0.0..They're all living creatures.
Dialogue: 0.1:13:41.79.1:13:46.40.Default..0.0.0..They may have been created artificially. but they are living creatures living in this world.
Dialogue: 0.1:13:46.40.1:13:48.52.Default..0.0.0..Real ones and copies...
Dialogue: 0.1:13:48.52.1:13:51.22.Default..0.0.0..But they are fellow living creatures all the same.
Dialogue: 0.1:13:51.22.1:13:52.63.Default..0.0.0..What does winning or losing mean?
Dialogue: 0.1:13:55.39.1:13:58.10.Default..0.0.0..No matter what you say...
Dialogue: 0.1:13:58.10.1:13:59.68.Default..0.0.0..It's no matter...
Dialogue: 0.1:13:59.68.1:14:02.44.Default..0.0.0..It's all wretched and miserable.
Dialogue: 0.1:14:02.44.1:14:04.81.Default..0.0.0..Like they're tormenting themselves...
Dialogue: 0.1:14:04.81.1:14:07.61.Default..0.0.0..It's like looking at my past self...
Dialogue: 0.1:14:07.61.1:14:10.28.Default..0.0.0..It's like looking at my current self...
Dialogue: 0.1:14:10.28.1:14:12.77.Default..0.0.0..This doesn't feel right...
Dialogue: 0.1:14:15.38.1:14:16.44.Default..0.0.0..Nyou!
Dialogue: 0.1:14:23.62.1:14:25.83.Default..0.0.0..These myust hurt...
Dialogue: 0.1:14:27.84.1:14:32.42.Default..0.0.0..Your fellow Pokémon nyare all battling. you're slacking!
Dialogue: 0.1:14:34.01.1:14:34.97.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:34.97.1:14:36.89.Default..0.0.0..You're shaying I'm slacking?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:36.89.1:14:39.63.Default..0.0.0..Why won't nyou battle me?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:41.73.1:14:44.12.Default..0.0.0..You're shaying these claws must hurt?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:44.12.1:14:47.18.Default..0.0.0..Your claws would hurt far myore!
Dialogue: 0.1:14:51.44.1:14:54.15.Default..0.0.0..Nyou bet tonyight's Moon will be ryound too?
Dialogue: 0.1:14:54.15.1:14:58.15.Default..0.0.0..I gyet you. Myust be a full moon.
Dialogue: 0.1:15:00.04.1:15:03.29.Default..0.0.0..Talkying abyout the Moon at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0.1:15:03.29.1:15:07.04.Default..0.0.0..Nyou're philosophising wyith elegance.
Dialogue: 0.1:15:46.37.1:15:47.66.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:16:26.50.1:16:27.57.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:16:35.09.1:16:36.96.Default..0.0.0..That's enough! Stop!
Dialogue: 0.1:16:37.76.1:16:38.48.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:16:38.48.1:16:39.88.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:16:40.93.1:16:42.51.Default..0.0.0..I have to stop them.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:42.51.1:16:43.51.Default..0.0.0..You can't.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:43.51.1:16:46.47.Default..0.0.0..This battle will keep going unless Mew and Mewtwo stop.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:50.10.1:16:55.39.Default..0.0.0..Living creatures will not yield their territory to members of their own species.
Dialogue: 0.1:16:56.07.1:16:57.40.Default..0.0.0..Oh no...
Dialogue: 0.1:16:57.40.1:17:00.04.Default..0.0.0..They will fight until they drive out their opponent.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:00.04.1:17:01.39.Default..0.0.0..That is the way of a living creature.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:05.22.1:17:07.15.Default..0.0.0..That's the way of a living creature?
Dialogue: 0.1:17:07.15.1:17:10.57.Default..0.0.0..But Mewtwo was created by humans.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:10.57.1:17:14.37.Default..0.0.0..But now they're just another creature.
Dialogue: 0.1:17:14.37.1:17:16.87.Default..0.0.0..Now a living creature?
Dialogue: 0.1:17:16.87.1:17:18.26.Default..0.0.0..Mew and Mewtwo...
Dialogue: 0.1:17:19.06.1:17:22.46.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu and that other Pikachu...
Dialogue: 0.1:18:25.40.1:18:26.02.Default..0.0.0..Stop it!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:26.02.1:18:27.03.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:27.03.1:18:28.40.Default..0.0.0..Please stop this!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:31.41.1:18:32.66.Default..0.0.0..Stop it!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:35.50.1:18:36.39.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:36.39.1:18:37.28.Default..0.0.0..Satoshi!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:45.92.1:18:46.99.Default..0.0.0..Absurd!
Dialogue: 0.1:18:46.99.1:18:49.92.Default..0.0.0..A human tried to stop our battle?
Dialogue: 0.1:19:33.27.1:19:34.43.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu...
Dialogue: 0.1:21:37.81.1:21:39.26.Default..0.0.0..Pikachu!
Dialogue: 0.1:22:14.18.1:22:15.62.Default..0.0.0..It is clear...
Dialogue: 0.1:22:15.62.1:22:19.88.Default..0.0.0..You and I are Pokémon that already exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:22.44.1:22:26.10.Default..0.0.0..It may be for the best that nobody knows of this incident.
Dialogue: 0.1:22:26.65.1:22:30.56.Default..0.0.0..It may be best if it is forgotten.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:10.48.1:23:13.12.Default..0.0.0..Where will you all go?
Dialogue: 0.1:23:13.12.1:23:15.02.Default..0.0.0..We were born.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:15.74.1:23:17.07.Default..0.0.0..We are alive.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:17.82.1:23:19.40.Default..0.0.0..We will continue to live.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:20.12.1:23:23.95.Default..0.0.0..Somewhere in this world...
Dialogue: 0.1:23:48.90.1:23:51.23.Default..0.0.0..We cannot send out ships in this storm.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:51.23.1:23:53.11.Default..0.0.0..The hurricane is drawing closer.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:53.11.1:23:54.20.Default..0.0.0..Please seek shelter.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:54.74.1:23:57.01.Default..0.0.0..No need to worry. everyone.
Dialogue: 0.1:23:57.01.1:24:00.25.Default..0.0.0..I am opening the Pokémon Centre as a safe shelter.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:00.25.1:24:03.45.Default..0.0.0..Please come with me if you wish to make use of it.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:08.63.1:24:11.75.Default..0.0.0..Nurse Joi. Officer Junsa and Miss Voyager...
Dialogue: 0.1:24:11.75.1:24:15.34.Default..0.0.0..They're all so beautiful today. even drenched in rain.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:15.34.1:24:18.72.Default..0.0.0..But what are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0.1:24:18.72.1:24:21.71.Default..0.0.0..No idea. But we're here. so we're here.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:23.56.1:24:25.04.Default..0.0.0..I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:25.04.1:24:25.72.Default..0.0.0..Yeah.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:27.54.1:24:28.08.Default..0.0.0..What's that?
Dialogue: 0.1:24:41.32.1:24:43.03.Default..0.0.0..How can this be?
Dialogue: 0.1:24:43.03.1:24:44.21.Default..0.0.0..The hurricane...
Dialogue: 0.1:24:44.21.1:24:45.74.Default..0.0.0..It's like it wasn't even real.
Dialogue: 0.1:24:46.25.1:24:48.87.Default..0.0.0..I reckon the ships can set sail tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:00.90.1:25:01.58.Default..0.0.0..What's that?
Dialogue: 0.1:25:02.60.1:25:03.22.Default..0.0.0..What?
Dialogue: 0.1:25:05.56.1:25:07.59.Default..0.0.0..I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:07.59.1:25:09.26.Default..0.0.0..Nothing but clouds.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:12.44.1:25:15.11.Default..0.0.0..On the day I set out on my journey.\N aiming to be a Pokémon Master...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:15.11.1:25:17.45.Default..0.0.0..I saw an Illusionary Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:17.45.1:25:19.27.Default..0.0.0.....and just now...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:19.86.1:25:22.32.Default..0.0.0..Maybe you'll meet again someday?
Dialogue: 0.1:25:22.32.1:25:23.23.Default..0.0.0..Huh?
Dialogue: 0.1:25:23.23.1:25:24.99.Default..0.0.0..The Illusionary Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:26.12.1:25:28.78.Default..0.0.0..Yeah. I'm sure I will someday.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:32.46.1:25:34.17.Default..0.0.0..Pocket Monsters...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:34.17.1:25:41.28.Default..0.0.0..This is a tale of those who aim to be Pokémon Masters and meet mysterious creatures called Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0.1:25:41.28.1:25:44.76.Default..0.0.0.....and so that journey will keep on continuing...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:51.31.1:25:54.15.Default..0.0.0..You know. there's nothing quite like this...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:54.15.1:25:55.82.Default..0.0.0..It's beautiful and refreshing...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:55.82.1:25:57.96.Default..0.0.0.....and different from usual...
Dialogue: 0.1:25:57.96.1:26:04.15.Default..0.0.0..This does feel right!
Dialogue: 0.1:26:34.50.1:26:44.48.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45\}How far will you go if you keep on walking?
Dialogue: 0.1:26:44.76.1:26:53.77.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45\}The Wind asks this and I come to a halt
Dialogue: 0.1:27:05.42.1:27:15.08.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45\}Your birthday candles may have increased. however...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:15.80.1:27:25.60.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}You've made a journey from your one and only hometown
Dialogue: 0.1:27:25.80.1:27:30.56.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Even now. you're still seeking something...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:31.00.1:27:35.80.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}With big shining eyes...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:36.18.1:27:40.88.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Something inside your pocket...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:41.36.1:27:47.62.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}With someone who is not you...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:47.90.1:27:52.42.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Countless encounters...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:52.96.1:27:58.02.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Countless farewells...
Dialogue: 0.1:27:58.18.1:28:08.90.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}You'll have a few memories a little like illusions
Dialogue: 0.1:28:10.20.1:28:20.42.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}How far will you go if you keep on walking?
Dialogue: 0.1:28:20.62.1:28:30.32.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}The Wind asks this and I look at the sky
Dialogue: 0.1:28:30.92.1:28:40.78.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Will you go far if you keep on walking?
Dialogue: 0.1:28:41.24.1:28:44.44.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Together with the Wind...
Dialogue: 0.1:28:44.52.1:28:50.88.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Let's walk forward once more
Dialogue: 0.1:28:51.32.1:28:56.74.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Let's step forth on this vast land...
Dialogue: 0.1:28:56.74.1:29:01.44.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}...and go anywhere and everywhere
Dialogue: 0.1:29:01.82.1:29:11.66.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Until we reach those dreams we've been aiming for...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:12.26.1:29:17.36.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Let's step forth on this vast land...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:17.36.1:29:22.52.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}...and go anywhere and everywhere
Dialogue: 0.1:29:22.52.1:29:32.42.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}Until we reach those dreams we've been aiming for...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:32.86.1:29:38.16.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}La la la la la la la...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:38.16.1:29:43.28.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}La la la la la la la la...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:43.28.1:29:48.50.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}La la la la la la la la...
Dialogue: 0.1:29:48.50.1:29:56.92.Default..0.0.0..{\fnBookman Old Style\fs45}La la la la la la...
